<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεῖα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰρ]</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστ-ήϊα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the meed of
				valour,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. διδόναι τῷ ἀξιωτάτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.123
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				124
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίτεε τοὺς Αἰγινήτας τὰ
			ἀ.</span> demanded of them <i>the reward</i> (they had
			received) <i>for prowess,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				122
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀ. τῆς νίκης φέρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				464
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				919e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.16
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς θεοῦ</span>
			offered to her, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.652<i>A</i>30
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεῖον τῷ θεῷ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				814a
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				276
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				9
			</span></i> (Delph.), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.72
			</span></i>: less freq. in sg. in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>D Deor.</i><i><span class="en">
				22.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in sg.,
				<i>monument of valour, memorial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πρὸς τοὺς βαρβάρους πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.272
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				59.97
			</span></i>.</div>
